    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "This species lives attached to sponges of several species, including Clathria virgultosa (Lamarck, 1814), Iotrochota birotulata (Higgin, 1877), and Agelas conifera (Schmidt, 1870); inhabits the fore-reef, and back-reef zones, between 6.0–25.0 m, but has been reported down to 50 m (Agudo 1987)."
